  "ruleText": "Fis 303.05 Bobcat. There shall be no open season for the taking of bobcat.\n\nSource. #1619, eff 8-8-80; amd by #1788, eff 7-29-81; ss by #2124, eff 8-17-82; amd by #2450, eff 8-19-83; ss by #2864, eff 9-27-84; ss by #3129, eff 10-1-85; ss by #4120, eff 8-21-86; ss by #4306, eff 8-28-87; ss by #4493, eff 9-22-88; ss by #4664, eff 8-21-89; ss by #4857, eff 7-3-90; ss by #5210, eff 8-26-91; ss by #5661, eff 6-28-93; ss by #5829, eff 5-24-94;ss by #6042, eff 5-18-95; ss by #6520, eff 5-31-97; ss by #6783, eff 6-30-98; ss by #7289, eff 6-1-00; ss by #7699, eff 6-5-02; ss by #8085, eff 5-26-04; amd by #8357, eff 5-25-05; ss by #8644, eff 6-1-06; ss by #8764, eff 11-23-06; ss and moved by #9163, eff 5-28-08 (formerly Fis 303.06); ss by #10619, eff 6-2-14; ss by #13970, eff 6-1-24",
